  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "‘Aarigaa!’: the triumph of Mary Peltola’s historic US Senate win and what it means for Alaska Natives",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/18/mary-peltola-alaska-win-analysis",
      "description": "<p>Peltola, the first Alaska Native in the US Senate, ran a campaign that drew universal issues from her own Indigenous politics</p><p>Late into the night on 3 November, while the lower 48 states were reeling from the blue wave crashing across the US, Mary Peltola took to the stage in a Sheraton Hotel ballroom in Anchorage, Alaska, to greet her supporters.</p><p>It wasn’t a victory speech as such – there would still be long days ahead before all votes could be counted across this vast arctic state. But that didn’t prevent the Democratic Senate<strong> </strong>candidate from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zusj8N52QnQ\">expressing her elation</a>, bouncing up and down on stage, clapping her hands and clicking her fingers.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/18/mary-peltola-alaska-win-analysis\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-18T04:25:29"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mary Peltola beats Republican Dan Sullivan in Alaska to give Democrats 56 Senate seats",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/17/mary-peltola-alaska-senate-race",
      "description": "<p>Republican incumbent beaten in race dominated by controversy over second candidate named Dan Sullivan</p><p>Democrat Mary Peltola will be Alaska’s next senator after beating the Republican incumbent Dan Sullivan, with the result called two weeks on from midterm elections which saw Donald Trump’s party lose ground across the country.</p><p>Peltola, a former US House lawmaker, is the first Democrat the state has elected to the Senate since 2008. Her victory comes just two years after Alaska voters unseated her while supporting Trump by a double-digit margin.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/17/mary-peltola-alaska-senate-race\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-18T03:25:14"
    },
    {
      "title": "Mary Peltola flips Alaska Senate seat in another Democratic win",
